# SLZ-RULE1 2026-11-19: a bare except whose LAST statement is a bare `raise`
# swallows nothing (Rollback; raise -- Storage.SQLite.pas:8464 shape): lines 11
# and 17 must not fire. Positive controls: a raise that is not last (22) and a
# handler with no raise at all (28) still fire.
bare-except 22
bare-except 28
!bare-except 11
!bare-except 17